Atrium OVR: cache the field-of-view probe (per-eye FOV and eye poses, stage bounds) per runtime +
headset in %APPDATA%\Atrium\ovr_fov_cache.txt so later launches skip it, and wait 2 s instead of
10 s for READY (Meta only signals READY once the headset is worn; its views are valid before).

